---
import AboutHeroImage from "../assets/about-me2.jpeg";
import Layout from "../layouts/BlogPost.astro";
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet"
	pubDate={new Date("August 08 2021")}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>Hey, I'm Qi.</p>
	In case you'd like to know a little more about me, I am from China. After college,
	I moved to the United States in the summer of 2016 to pursue a graduate degree
	in Electrical and Computer Engineering at Carnegie Mellon University. After graduating,
	I worked at BNY Mellon and later at Amazon.
	<p>
		I'm currently living in the Netherlands, where I'm doing a master's
		degree in Computer Science at Leiden University and working with
		Randstad on my thesis internship.
	</p>
	In my free time, I enjoy hanging out with friends and reading. I also like hiking
	when I'm traveling, although I usually stick to day hikes, haha.
	<p>
		With this blog, I'd simply like to share my English-learning journey as
		a non-native English speaker living in Europe: the new words and
		expressions I come across, the mistakes I make, and the little things I
		continue to learn along the way.
	</p>
</Layout>
